  description: Ratogres are hulking ratkin brutes, ogre-sized monsters with swollen,
    muscular frames and thick tails dragging behind them. They move with a slow,
    ponderous gait, though when enraged they can surge forward in short bursts. Their
    throats produce deep, bestial roars rather than articulate words, more beast
    than thinking creature.
